  "question": {
    "text": "The solution of the differential equation <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is <math><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math> (where,&nbsp;<math><mi>C</mi></math> is an arbitrary constant and&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>). Then, the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
