  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given equation is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br />On integrating, we get,</p><p><math><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math> or <math><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
